// ADR-0021 decision 7: the resource script that embeds the
// `requireAdministrator` manifest into `admin-template-fw-elev.exe` only
// (build.rs links it to that `[[bin]]` with `embed_resource::compile_for`).
//
// `1 24 "..."` is CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID = 1, RT_MANIFEST = 24
// (the minimal form that needs no windows.h).

1 24 "admin-template-fw-elev.manifest"
